      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPER STRIDE (6) was quick to begin and led early before boxing on for a placing when second (22.29) at Maitland in Grade 4/5. Missed the placings only try here. Yet to taste defeat from two runs out of this box. Expected to feature in the finish again. HOVERING (3) produced a modest effort most recently when sixth at Richmond over 401m behind Release Point (23.63) in a Grade 5. Should be about the money. SLEEK APOLLO (2) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by 2.75 lengths at Richmond in a handy 22.98 beating All The Cash. Has a solid record from this box including three wins and a minor placing. Capable of going well again. SASSY CROSSED (1) is a surprise last-start placegetter who should be thereabouts.",
